    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d758">

                <pb facs="0780" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/3859: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-02-15T21:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                                1919, 9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:45
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>769. The Esthonian delegation has addressed a request to me as Secretary of State
                    repeating its petition of May 5 [<hi rendition="#italic">3</hi>] last<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d758-f1"/> that the independence of Esthonia be recognized and
                    requesting recognition of the right of Esthonia as a belligerent nation during
                    the war against the Russian Federative Communist Republic.</p>
                <p>Attached to above communication was copy of note to President of Peace Conference
                    asserting Esthonia’s independence, recognized provisionally by British, French,
                    and Italian Governments, and <pb facs="0781" n="669" xml:id="pg669"/> accepting
                    the Prinkipo invitation with the provision that if any decision should be taken
                    there regarding Esthonian independence, Esthonian Government will not consider
                    itself so bound.</p>
                <p>Opinion of Commission is same as that expressed with regard to recognition
                    Lithuania (see my telegram number 708 [<hi rendition="#italic">768</hi>]
                    February 15, 9 [<hi rendition="#italic">3</hi>] p.m.).</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>] <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
